  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The earth aids your passage, moving you at great speeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Oread Earth Glider<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can earth glide at a speed equal to your base speed plus 5 feet for every two mythic tiers (minimum 5 feet) you possess. You can burrow through stone at your base speed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
